                    "maxLength": 4000000,
                    "description": "The file TEXT — not base64, not a URL, not a multipart upload: both formats are text documents, so they travel inside the JSON body like any other field. Max 4,000,000 characters per file and 8,000,000 across the request; over either is a 413. ⚠️ The HTTP body cap differs by path: 10 MB on `/v1/optimize/nest` and `/v1/import/nest`, but the DEFAULT 1 MB on `/v1/validate/nest`, which is the only nest path that needs no key. A source body over 1 MB therefore validates on the optimize path, not the free one."
